  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The study was designed to determine the temporal and spatial patterns of polar bears in the Southern Beaufort Sea population.  The data consists of GPS satellite collared adult females and subadults of both sexes collected between 2005 and 2012.  Analyses include habitat use, population delineation, oil spill modelling, climate change, movement dynamics, and population estimation."
